        "original_id": "2cd5dcd6-108f-59d6-bc1f-cef8dad5dd9c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Phelps, Klete Keller, Ryan Lochte, Peter Vanderkaay, Young Jeezy, Detail, Akon, Ray J, Lil Wayne, Beyoncé, Wiz Khalifa\n- Topics: Olympic swimming, relay team, songs, music production\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Fred Phelps II was born on June 30, 1985.\n- Michael Phelps is an American former competitive swimmer.\n- Michael Phelps is the most decorated Olympian of all time with 28 medals.\n- The American relay team of Michael Phelps, Ryan Lochte, Peter Vanderkaay, and Klete Keller has been undefeated since the Athens games.\n- Michael Phelps is referenced in Young Jeezy's verse on the song \"I'm So Paid.\"\n- Detail is known for producing hit singles including \"Sexy Can I\" by Ray J, \"I'm So Paid\" by Akon, \"How to Love\" by Lil Wayne, \"Drunk in Love\" and \"711\" by Beyoncé, and \"We Dem Boyz\" by Wiz Khalifa.",
